From: flange <flange@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] dts: rk3566-orangepi-cm4: 禁用 rknpu / rknpu_mmu

Orange Pi CM4 首启在 rk_iommu_driver_init 绑定 rknpu_mmu 时触发 NPU
power domain 上电，PMU 等不到 npu ack 后被 BSP 硬编码 panic：

  rockchip-pm-domain fdd90000.power-management:power-controller:
    failed to get ack on domain 'npu', target_idle = 0, target_ack = 0, val=0x6
  Kernel panic - not syncing: panic_on_set_idle set ...

调用链为：

  rk_iommu_driver_init (rknpu_mmu) probe → __genpd_dev_pm_attach
    → genpd_power_on → rockchip_pmu_set_idle_request(NPU PD)
    → ack 超时 → panic_on_set_idle

rk356x.dtsi 默认把 rknpu 与 rknpu_mmu 标为 disabled，问题出在
rk3566-orangepi-cm4.dtsi 又把两处 override 为 okay。当前板级目标优先保
证系统可启动；在确认该板 NPU 上电链可用前，禁用 rknpu / rknpu_mmu，避
免 rknpu_mmu 被 probe 后拉起 NPU power domain。

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-orangepi-cm4.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-orangepi-cm4.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-orangepi-cm4.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-orangepi-cm4.dtsi
@@ -809,11 +809,11 @@
 
 &rknpu {
 	rknpu-supply = <&vdd_npu>;
-	status = "okay";
+	status = "disabled";
 };
 
 &rknpu_mmu {
-	status = "okay";
+	status = "disabled";
 };
 
 &route_hdmi {
